</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources to make your base!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/9fa2d6bac7db38ec493e7963cfecb1b2.poster.avif?t=1754776666\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/9fa2d6bac7db38ec493e7963cfecb1b2.webm?t=1754776666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/9fa2d6bac7db38ec493e7963cfecb1b2.mp4?t=1754776666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Multiplayer</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with your friends in friend only games or join a dedicated server! The servers are optimized to handle up to 25 players! (It could handle more but I never tested it) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Other features</u></strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles with procedural rewards</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caves</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A high skillcap forge minigame</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pets system (from Eggs)</p></li></ul>",
